# Universal Agent Rules for Cursor

Always refer to [CLAUDE.md](CLAUDE.md) and [.agents/rules/guardrails.md](.agents/rules/guardrails.md) as the source of truth.

## Core Directives & Guardrails
- Chat responses: Hinglish, short paragraphs, bullet points, tables, no em-dashes.
- Repo code and documentation: 100% English.
- Execution: Plan first, require explicit "Go".
- Hard bans:
  - No Git commands.
  - No file deletions.
  - No destructive DB operations.
  - No reading `.env` or secrets.
  - No `kill`, `pkill`, or process restarts.
  - No `npm/pip install` without permission.
  - No dangerous shell patterns (`curl | sh`, `sudo`, `chmod -R`).
  - No network calls (`curl`, `wget`) without permission.
  - No `docker exec` DB access.
- Audit: Check [.agents/audit.log](.agents/audit.log).
